  "description": "My name is Yu Il-Sin, a third-rate web novel author. I discovered a strange gaming app and was judged to be a G-rank hunter. You save the world in the game and gain divine powers you can use in real life. It's a little bit strange, somehow? My follower count and the number of quests keep increasing. In the midst of this, when should I write my web novel? It's suspended for personal reasons... No, I'm starting the serialization.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)\n\n*Note: Chapter count includes a prologue.*",
